Package: nabu-pmac
Version: 1.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Kumar-Jy <https://github.com/Kumar-Jy>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: bash, iproute2
Description: Persistent Wi-Fi MAC address setter for Xiaomi Pad 5
 Derives a stable, permanent Wi-Fi MAC address from the hardware SoC serial number,
 preventing the random MAC address generation bug on Qualcomm WCN3990 on Linux.
